1
00:00:00,170 --> 00:00:03,440
Let's practice talking about your company.

2
00:00:03,470 --> 00:00:07,520
You can say I work at a big company.

3
00:00:07,550 --> 00:00:09,880
I work at a small company.

4
00:00:09,890 --> 00:00:13,040
I work at a middle sized company.

5
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:19,730
If you want to say the name of the company, you can say, I work at Facebook.

6
00:00:19,760 --> 00:00:24,660
I work at Google or I work for Facebook.

7
00:00:24,680 --> 00:00:27,110
I work for Google.

8
00:00:27,650 --> 00:00:32,780
You can also say I am a part of a big international team.

9
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:37,100
I am a member of a small remote team.

10
00:00:37,610 --> 00:00:38,330
Good.

11
00:00:38,690 --> 00:00:45,260
If you want to describe where you work your location, you can say I work in the office.

12
00:00:45,380 --> 00:00:47,330
I work from home.

13
00:00:47,480 --> 00:00:49,380
I work remotely.

14
00:00:49,400 --> 00:00:51,860
I have a home office.

15
00:00:52,190 --> 00:00:55,610
I have a hybrid work mode.

16
00:00:56,310 --> 00:00:57,210
Perfect.

17
00:00:57,210 --> 00:01:01,350
Repeat and use the phrases to talk about yourself.

18
00:01:01,380 --> 00:01:02,820
See you next time.

19
00:01:02,820 --> 00:01:03,630
Bye.
